    <string name="a11y_service_summary">Letters translations onto manga pages.</string>
    <string name="a11y_service_description">Serifu takes screenshots of the reader apps you choose, recognises the text on your device and draws translations on top. Nothing leaves your phone unless you turn on the optional API engine. Serifu does not read other apps\' content, and it never uses your keystrokes except to notice volume-key page turns.</string>

